;
; How Kindred files one contact in MYRA (kindred_rules.h KR5): its number,
; its card code (0 none, else the verified agent_id's first 12 hex digits
; plus 1), its node code (the same of its NodeID from net.peers), its name
; code (the first 9 letters, two digits each), whether its card verified
; (0 or 1) and when it was last changed (ms since 1970).
^ZXKINDRED(contact:i6) = card:i15! ^ node:i15! ^ name:i18! ^ verified:i1! ^ stamp:i13!
